  {
    "version": "v0.9",
    "updateComponents": {
      "surfaceId": "paint-calculator",
      "components": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "component": "Column",
          "children": [
            "summary-heading",
            "summary-text",
            "divider-1",
            "detailed-heading",
            "detailed-steps",
            "gallons-heading",
            "gallons-text",
            "breakdown-heading",
            "breakdown-table",
            "actions-heading",
            "actions-row"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "summary-heading",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h3",
          "text": "Summary"
        },
        {
          "id": "summary-text",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "body",
          "text": "To paint your room's four walls with two coats, you will need to purchase 3 gallons of paint."
        },
        {
          "id": "divider-1",
          "component": "Divider"
        },
        {
          "id": "detailed-heading",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h4",
          "text": "Detailed Calculation"
        },
        {
          "id": "detailed-steps",
          "component": "List",
          "direction": "vertical",
          "children": [
            "step-1",
            "step-2",
            "step-3",
            "step-4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "step-1",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "body",
          "text": "1. Calculate the perimeter of the room:\n(14 feet + 12 feet) * 2 = 26 feet * 2 = 52 feet"
        },
        {
          "id": "step-2",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "body",
          "text": "2. Calculate the total area of the four walls:\n52 feet (perimeter) * 8 feet (height) = 416 square feet"
        },
        {
          "id": "step-3",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "body",
          "text": "3. Calculate the total area to be painted with two coats:\n416 square feet * 2 coats = 832 square feet"
        },
        {
          "id": "step-4",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "body",
          "text": "4. Calculate the number of gallons needed:\n832 square feet / 350 square feet per gallon = 2.377 gallons"
        },
        {
          "id": "gallons-heading",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h4",
          "text": "Gallons to Purchase"
        },
        {
          "id": "gallons-text",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "body",
          "text": "Since paint is typically sold in whole gallons, you will need to round up to the next whole gallon.\nYou should purchase 3 gallons of paint."
        },
        {
          "id": "breakdown-heading",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h4",
          "text": "Calculation Breakdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "breakdown-table",
